people don't experience those kinds of feelings.
And we can talk about some of the studies,

00:02:08.420 --> 00:02:12.200
say, in those experiences. So the question
then is what happens if we accept that polarization

00:02:12.200 --> 00:02:15.870
is increasing? And that does seem to be true,
and if we accept the polarization is something

00:02:15.870 --> 00:02:21.510
that's kind of independent of like, no, some
one political group actually is saying repugnant

00:02:21.510 --> 00:02:24.330
things, like objectively repugnant things.
