00:02:30.360 --> 00:02:33.590
about what those things are, but you could
say something like, how does something like

00:02:33.590 --> 00:02:37.370
climate change become political? How does
something like what car you drive? Or What

00:02:37.370 --> 00:02:41.380
if you drive a car or what your favorite drink
