00:02:54.340 --> 00:02:58.500
So the way that small things turn into big
things, basically, and what he says is if

00:02:58.500 --> 00:03:04.920
you if you model digitally people in a large
social network, all it takes is really two

00:03:04.920 --> 00:03:10.340
conditions to get real serious bad polarization.
All you have to do, first of all, is make

00:03:10.340 --> 00:03:15.710
sure that people are connecting with with
non-local connections. So that means strangers,

00:03:15.710 --> 00:03:19.060
